        ### Diagrams

        ![Logic block diagram](assets/diagrams/hi3521av100-logic.svg)

        ![Register blocks by function](assets/diagrams/hi3521av100-blocks.svg)

        ![Clock tree](assets/diagrams/hi3521av100-clocks.svg)

