        | VI0_CLK | muxctrl_reg0 @0x000 | 0=GPIO5_7 / 1=VI0_CLK / 2=VI_ADC_REFCLK0 |
        | VI0_DAT7 ... VI0_DAT0 (8) | muxctrl_reg1 ... muxctrl_reg8 @0x004 ... 0x020 | 0=GPIO1_0 / 1=VI0_DAT7 (first pad; others the same pattern with the pad's own number) |
        | VI1_CLK | muxctrl_reg9 @0x024 | 0=GPIO10_6 / 1=VI1_CLK / 2=VI0_CLK |
